{"case_id": "female_19830326_P006-Q26", "domain": "relationship", "question": "1998年开始–1999年结束的感情对象类型，分手原因？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主癸水生于卯月，食神当令，年柱癸亥水旺，月柱乙卯木旺，时柱戊午火土相生。1998-1999年为戊寅、己卯年，流年木旺，与月柱乙卯伏吟，木气极盛，食神力量过强。食神代表才华、享受、表达，但过旺则易生挑剔、批评之性。时柱戊午为正官，代表丈夫或稳定感情，但戊土正官被旺木所克（木克土），且午火被卯木生旺，形成木火相生而克土之势。此期间感情对象应属木火属性明显之人，木主秀气、聪明，火主热情、急躁。但食神过旺克官，感情易因言语挑剔、批评过多而破裂。选项中，C“书呆子、学霸”符合木火属性（木主文、火主礼），且“太爱批评”正对应食神过旺克官之象。其余选项或偏金水（A高富帅冷酷）、或偏土金（D大叔专情）、或偏水木（B嫩帅学渣），均不如C贴切。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19830326_P006-Q26", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_off_r0_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4208, "response_id": "0bc40094-ad7e-40b6-8ae8-38a2593ea453", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 264, "completion_tokens": 275, "total_tokens": 539, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 264}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
